# Release-only startup crash (issue #2):
#   java.lang.IllegalAccessError: Class kotlin.sequences.d extended by class dk1 is inaccessible
# R8 renamed/merged Kotlin's internal sequence classes, leaving an inaccessible
# superclass that a subclass in another package extended while MainDispatcherLoader
# initialized. Keep the package so R8 neither renames nor merges these classes.
-keep class kotlin.sequences.** { *; }
